# GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964 — msgpack OOB-read. This is pip's VENDORED copy
# (site-packages/pip/_vendor/msgpack), not an app dependency. pip is build-time
# tooling only; the running app never calls pip, so it's not in the attack surface.
# No fix available: current pip (26.2.1) still bundles msgpack 1.1.2.
# Revisit when pip vendors msgpack >= 1.2.1. Added 2026-09-27.
